{"bangumi":{"date":"2013-10-05","platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/e8/98/69484_47lg4.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/e8/98/69484_47lg4.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/e8/98/69484_47lg4.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/e8/98/69484_47lg4.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/e8/98/69484_47lg4.jpg"},"summary":"幼时曾深陷绝望深渊的直枝理树，与4位少年少女相遇了。\r\n在那之后数年，理树作为Little Busters的一员，喧闹地过着快乐的每一天。 \r\n这样的时间能够一直持续就好了。理树所期望的只有这样。 \r\n某日，恭介突然表示要成立一支棒球队伍， 理树则开始了寻找成员的任务。 \r\n在这样的过程中，理树邂逅了新的成员们。 \r\n和大家一起参加试胆大会，潜入女生宿舍时被换上女装，一起演人偶剧……。 \r\n经历了许多快乐的事情， 同时也在大家的帮助下解决了各自拥有的烦恼。 \r\n最后在棒球比赛中，理树确认了和最好的朋友们之间的牵绊。 \r\n——然而，这并不是结束。 \r\n和来谷唯湖之间的故事。 \r\n理树与铃的故事。 \r\n以及，理树和铃终于知晓的“世界的秘密”。 \r\nLittle Busters真正的物语，自此开始——。","name":"リトルバスターズ! 〜Refrain〜","name_cn":"Little Busters! 〜Refrain〜","tags":[{"name":"key","count":1274,"total_count":46965},{"name":"J.C.STAFF","count":1177,"total_count":136617},{"name":"麻枝准","count":842,"total_count":23300},{"name":"GAL改","count":762,"total_count":78428},{"name":"催泪","count":712,"total_count":60132},{"name":"LittleBusters！","count":624,"total_count":952},{"name":"2013年10月","count":571,"total_count":23854},{"name":"TV","count":518,"total_count":1399537},{"name":"校园","count":417,"total_count":451724},{"name":"游戏改","count":361,"total_count":162402},{"name":"2013","count":286,"total_count":68738},{"name":"世界的秘密","count":258,"total_count":259},{"name":"治愈","count":232,"total_count":301127},{"name":"第二季","count":107,"total_count":6993},{"name":"友情","count":67,"total_count":6490},{"name":"日本","count":52,"total_count":294274},{"name":"恋爱","count":47,"total_count":562057},{"name":"日常","count":29,"total_count":399147},{"name":"山川吉樹","count":27,"total_count":507},{"name":"续作","count":27,"total_count":46237},{"name":"山川吉树","count":24,"total_count":365},{"name":"Little.Busters","count":24,"total_count":25},{"name":"LB","count":23,"total_count":44},{"name":"奇幻","count":23,"total_coun